+// ---- M4.6 metadata-swap Tier-1 / Tier-2 runner dispatch (proposal 0015 PR item 6) ----
+//
+// The M2/M3 tiers above (`run_jepsen`, `run_kill_reconstruct`) exercise the **chunkstore
